WEBVTT

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:32.263
Our largest vaccine maker,
Serum Institute,

00:05:32.297 --> 00:05:37.030
in fact partnered with Oxford University
even before AstraZeneca did.

00:05:37.363 --> 00:05:40.430
And they agreed to help Oxford University

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.763
by saying that we will actually
manufacture this at risk

00:05:43.797 --> 00:05:46.363
so that you can start clinical trials.

00:05:46.397 --> 00:05:47.530
And then, of course,

00:05:47.563 --> 00:05:52.263
AstraZeneca came into the picture
and then, you know,

00:05:52.263 --> 00:05:59.130
Serum Institute is still making very large
quantities of the vaccines at scale

00:05:59.163 --> 00:06:03.197
and supplying it to COVAX
and many other countries